# Source-of-truth WordPress uploads tree — 3.0 GB, backed up off-machine.
# Local-only by decision D1 in EXECUTION.md. Only the ~700 originals that
# projects actually reference get committed, into content/images/.
# sources/UPLOADS-MANIFEST.txt records a SHA-256 for every file in it.
sources/uploads/

# Source-tier web masters — 704 files, 220 MB. Generated by
# `node scripts/sync-media.mjs` from sources/uploads in about three minutes,
# so nothing is lost while this is ignored.
#
# HELD OUT PENDING A DECISION: plain git vs Git LFS. Committing 220 MB of
# binaries to plain history is effectively permanent — removing them later
# means rewriting history and breaking every clone. See EXECUTION.md D7.
# Delete this block once the decision is made.
content/images/

# Build artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.cache/

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Note: the WXR export and SQL dump are deliberately NOT ignored here.
# Step 1 relocates them to sources/ and decides tracked-vs-LFS.
